From: Yang Zhengguo <yangzhgg@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 30 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: add CV upload and Wi-Fi radar direct buffer ids

QCN9274 firmware advertises direct-buffer module IDs 2
(WMI_CONFIG_MODULE_CV_UPLOAD) and 3 (WMI_CONFIG_MODULE_WIFI_RADAR).
Without the corresponding host enum values ath12k logs "ignoring
unsupported dma ring module id 2/3" on every boot and rejects the
service-ready capability, so the TLV parse stays incomplete.

Add both IDs. Origins: Rajat Soni and Harish Rachakonda (Qualcomm),
as carried by the SBE1V1K tree.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/wmi.h
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/wmi.h
@@ -2331,5 +2331,7 @@ enum wmi_direct_buffer_module {
 	WMI_DIRECT_BUF_SPECTRAL = 0,
 	WMI_DIRECT_BUF_CFR = 1,
+	WMI_DIRECT_BUF_CV_UPLOAD = 2,
+	WMI_CONFIG_MODULE_WIFI_RADAR = 3,
 
 	/* keep it last */
 	WMI_DIRECT_BUF_MAX
